<p>The context diagram in Fig. 4.3 treats the platform as a single process and identifies the
external entities it exchanges data with: the authenticated user, the model provider, the execution
sandbox and the managed data store. Fig. 4.4 decomposes that process into the five sub-processes
that carry all seven modules, together with the persistent stores each one reads and writes.</p>
<p style="text-align:center"><img src="fig-4-3.svg" width="578" height="147" alt="[ Fig. 4.3 — insert from the PDF version ]"></p>
